%                                                                             %

%   R e g i s t e r J P E G I m a g e                                         %

%                                                                             %

%                                                                             %

%                                                                             %

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

%

%  RegisterJPEGImage() adds properties for the JPEG image format to

%  the list of supported formats.  The properties include the image format

